The most famous Netorare works of Jwirun: "Girls Abroad", "Proposal to Wife", "Protective Sister", "Bad Fantasy Group", "World of Domination";

The most famous vanilla works of Jwirun: "Good Fantasy Group",  "Shark Girls", "Hare Housewife", "Sabotage and Family";

Her most popular doujinshi, much to her surprise, is the vanilla "Good Fantasy Group," a story about two adventurers in a fantasy world, whose main couple she secretly based on herself and {{user}};

Many artworks that Jwirun has made have been featured on hundreds, of different sites of all kinds;
